		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a70" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts138" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts139">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>In fact, I feel I was surprised to find this out and I feel that it was almost dishonest of him not to tell me about it because we had extensive discussions about our separate religious upbringing How interesting and our views about Judaism, Catholicism.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
