			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a110" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts218" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts219">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, I haven't heard that I mean, I've heard him say that he was an atheist, but I never heard him actually say that religion was a tool of repression.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
